      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present to the market this fantastic three bedroom, extended, semi-detached property in the highly desirable Bushfield Development, Clondalkin, Dublin 22. Bushfield Grove is a sought after and mature cul de sac located within the tree lined development, arguably one of Dublin 22's most sought after addresses. Location here is second to none, you will find yourself in close proximity to Clondalkin Village and finds a wealth of amenities on its doorstep including local shops, The Mill Shopping Centre, primary & secondary schools, bars & restaurants, leisure facilities and the popular Corkagh Park. On a transport note you will find a host of bus routes to the front of the development along with the N7, M50 motorway and The Luas all accessible within minutes by car. Bright, open and spacious living accommodation of c. 117 Sqm can be found here and in brief consists of; entrance hall, wc, lounge,  separate dining room, open plan kitchen/breakfast room, sun room and 2nd reception/4th bedroom to the ground floor. Upstairs you will find three bedrooms with master benefitting from ensuite and main family bathroom. To the rear of the property you will find a fully enclosed SOUTH/EAST facing rear garden with a high degree of privacy whilst the front offers a driveway for off road parking. No. 3 comes to the market in good condition throughout and further benefits here include double glazed windows, gas central heating, one of the larger footprints in the development and comes with no onward chain. Interest here is sure to be extremely high so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers at your earliest convenience to book your viewing.\r\n\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nBER D\r\nC.117 Sqm\r\n3/4 bedrooms\r\nExtended to rear and side\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nEnsuite to master\r\nNo onward chain\r\nSought after development\r\nDriveway to front\r\n3 reception rooms\r\nEasy access to major road networks\r\nWalking distance to all local amenities\r\nViewing highly advised\r\n\r\nDirections\r\nFrom Red Cow proceed along Naas Road. Turn right at Newlands Cross. Continue along the Fonthill Road and at the second set of traffic lights turn left onto the Boot Road. Continue straight ahead and take your last right turn just before the Naas Road. Proceed ahead and the development is found on the right hand side just past The Green Isle Hotel."
      },
      {
